{"id":"c100dce18000d9e7","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-path-connected.md","title":"Path Connected","display":"df-path-connected — Path Connected","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-path-connected","aliases":["58-df-path-connected"],"display":"df-path-connected — Path Connected","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-path.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-path-connected"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-path-connected</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-path-connected — Path Connected"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"600d3de34015fa31\" href=\"?note=600d3de34015fa31\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-path.md\">../batch04/58-df-path.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span> (candidate topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (path predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"600d3de34015fa31\" href=\"?note=600d3de34015fa31\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-path.md\">../batch04/58-df-path.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (path-connected predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected} \\vdash \\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected} \\vdash \\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Path connectedness is a property of a specified topological space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span>; the path predicate supplies the domain, continuity, and endpoint conditions.</li>\n<li>Both endpoints, the carrier, and its topology are passed to the source's five-place path predicate; no ambient topology is inferred from the carrier alone.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-path.md","status":"resolved","id":"600d3de34015fa31","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-path.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-path.md","status":"resolved","id":"600d3de34015fa31","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (path predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-path.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Path}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected} \\vdash \\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Path}_S(\\gamma,x,y,X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false}],"bytes":1276,"backlinks":[{"id":"01ebb1c67b142b36","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"78e4218bb3804257","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-path-connected.md]])"},{"id":"7518a72e7d60ad45","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S$ is the predicate from [[58-df-path-connected]] and $\\operatorna